## Why This Is Asked

Tests for feature-flagged checkout in a distributed payment system reflect real-world concerns: rollout safety, concurrency, compliance, and observability.

## Key Concepts

- Feature flags and canary/shadow testing
- Idempotency and race conditions
- End-to-end across services
- Observability and rollback criteria

## Code Example

```javascript
// Example: idempotent checkout invocation
async function runIdempotentCheckout(key) {
  const first = await checkout.perform({ amount: 1000, customerId: 'C1' }, key);
  const second = await checkout.perform({ amount: 1000, customerId: 'C1' }, key);
  if (first.orderId !== second.orderId) throw new Error('Non-idempotent');
}
```

